## Project Editor
Open the text-based project editor and compiler workspace.
?button[action:"/project-editor.html" text:"Open Project Editor" type:"button"](#open-project-editor)

:column[]()

## Stop Editor
Stop the local editor server when you are done.
?button[action:"editorApp.exitEditor" text:"Stop Editor" type:"button"](#stop-editor)

:/column
:column[size:"1"]()

## Switch Project
Point the editor at another Slamhaus project root.
?button[action:"editorApp.browseProject" text:"Choose Project" type:"button"](#browse-project)

:/column

